{
  "id": "minimax",
  "name": "MiniMax Code",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "api_level": 2,
  "description": "把宿主的 OpenAI 兼容请求转发到 MiniMax Code 的 agent 后端（https://agent.minimax.cn/mavis/api/v1/llm/v1/messages）。上游说的是 Anthropic Messages 协议并以 SSE 流式回答，本插件负责 OpenAI <-> Anthropic 双向转换、把流折成一次性补全、以及 OAuth 设备码登录（/oauth2/device/code + PKCE，后台轮询 /oauth2/token，处理 pending/slow_down/denied/expired）与 refresh_token 续期或粘贴 access_token。可按账号读取宿主写入的 egress.json，把上游调用路由到本地代理出口（blocked/strict 下失败关闭）。凭据由插件自持（DATA_DIR\\accounts.dat，DPAPI 保护），不经宿主环境变量传入。",
  "author": "",
  "homepage": "https://agent.minimax.cn",
  "os": [
    "windows"
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "upstream",
    "accounts",
    "quota",
    "refresh",
    "login_oauth",
    "login_paste_code",
    "egress"
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "read_paths": [],
    "launch_apps": [],
    "network_domains": [
      "agent.minimax.cn",
      "account.minimax.cn"
    ],
    "use_proxy": true,
    "os_identity": false,
    "require_admin": false
  },
  "egress": {
    "strict": false
  },
  "models": [
    {
      "id": "MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview",
      "name": "M3.1-Flash-Preview",
      "context_length": 1000000,
      "tools": true,
      "vision": true,
      "thinking": [
        "default",
        "low",
        "medium",
        "high",
        "xhigh",
        "max"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiniMax-M3",
      "name": "M3",
      "context_length": 1000000,
      "tools": true,
      "vision": true,
      "thinking": [
        "on",
        "none"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed",
      "name": "M2.7-highspeed",
      "context_length": 200000,
      "tools": true,
      "vision": false,
      "thinking": [
        "adaptive"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MiniMax-M2.7",
      "name": "M2.7",
      "context_length": 200000,
      "tools": true,
      "vision": false,
      "thinking": [
        "adaptive"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "login": {
    "methods": [
      "oauth",
      "paste_code"
    ],
    "reads_local_state": false,
    "requires_app": false,
    "auto_refresh": true,
    "notes": "OAuth 设备码（RFC 8628）+ PKCE；/oauth2/device/code 取 code，浏览器打开 verification_uri_complete 授权，插件后台按 interval 轮询 /oauth2/token（处理 HTTP 400 的 authorization_pending/slow_down/access_denied/expired_token），成功后 DPAPI 落库；也可粘贴 access_token。续期走 /oauth2/token 的 refresh_token 授权。"
  },
  "quota": {
    "poll_minutes": 30
  },
  "concurrency": {
    "suggested": 2
  },
  "rules": {
    "packs": []
  },
  "startup": {
    "mode": "always",
    "idle_timeout_s": 600
  },
  "entry": {
    "exe": "minimax-plugin.exe",
    "args": []
  }
}
